error[E0277]: `String` is not a field a view can read its key from
 --> tests/ui/view_key_field_is_not_a_key.rs:9:10
  |
9 |     key: String,
  |          ^^^^^^ not a view key
  |
  = help: the trait `ViewKey` is not implemented for `String`
  = note: a `#[view(key)]` field is a `ViewKey` (`ValueKey<T>`, `UniqueKey`, `GlobalKey<T>`, …), an `Option` of one, or an `Rc<dyn ViewKey>` or `Box<dyn ViewKey>`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `ViewKey`:
            GlobalKey<T>
            ObjectKey
            SaltedKey
            UniqueKey
            ValueKey<T>
  = note: required for `String` to implement `AsViewKey`
